## Remaining Tasks (Phase 2 Execution)
- [ ] **Unify Header & Navigation**: Restructure [layout.ejs](file:///Users/andrewbrazzatti/source/github/redbox-portal-2/views/layout.ejs) to combine the top utility bar ("Welcome Local Admin") and the main navigation into a single cohesive, top-level modern component.
- [ ] **Global Application of Bento Cards**: Ensure `.bento-card` layout is applied to all major containers universally (e.g., Login page, Record Editor, Settings), not just the Dashboard.
- [ ] **Table Striping Cleanup**: Explicitly override and remove Bootstrap's `.table-striped` high-contrast zebra striping globally in favor of the clean 1px bottom-borders.
- [ ] **Refine Default Colors & Hover States**: Systematically replace the remaining default generic blue/red button backgrounds and hover states with theme-specific variants (Deep Slate / Deep Rose).
